WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
A SUMO screen recording shows connected multilane roads and intersections from above. The recorded view pans and zooms across the network.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.500
A closer view shows a four-way intersection. Small vehicle symbols move along lanes, queue on the approaches, and pass through the junction.

00:09.500 --> 00:15.500
The view zooms out, moves to another part of the network, and zooms into a second four-way intersection with vehicles on its approaches.

00:15.500 --> 00:22.000
The view moves along connecting roads and neighboring intersections while simulated traffic continues to move. The excerpt ends without a results comparison.
